WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers,

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.669
and this is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:04.804
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.473
The 73rd annual
Primetime Emmy Awards

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:09.809
were hosted last night
by Cedric the Entertainer,

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.545
with an assist
from Rita the Rapper.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:16.949
Around 400 people attended the
so-called Justice for J6 rally

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.651
over the weekend,
held at the Capitol.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.754
Well, it's not as many
as they hoped for,

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.791
but that's still
a lot of reporters.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.160
During a lecture last week,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.362
Supreme Court Justice Clarence
Thomas said

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.331
that the court had its flaws
and compared it

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.634
to a "car with three wheels."

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.970
Well, you know what you do
to a car with three wheels.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.208
Re-tire it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.177
Do you follow what I'm saying,
Clarence Thomas?

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:47.746
You retire it.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:49.015
Mike Scollins liked it so much,

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.817
he wanted me to say
the punch line twice.

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.052
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:57.757
He thought that maybe
the standing ovation...

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.126
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.128
I would say it
over the standing ovation.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.697
The House of Representatives
returned Tuesday

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.565
from its August recess.
Oh, good.

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:08.734
Just in time for October.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.337
in a new interview,
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden said

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.539
that their German shepherd
Major's habit

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.474
of biting Secret Service agents

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:17.610
has caused her
and President Biden

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.480
to delay bringing a cat
into the White House,

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.582
because as much as it hurts
to get bitten,

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.518
it hurts even more
to be ignored.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.655
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio's
press secretary

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.224
announced yesterday that he will
step down next month

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.025
to open
a political consulting firm,

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:35.261
which will teach
aspiring politicians,

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.496
I guess, what not to do?

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:40.300
Customs officials said recently

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.936
that they have intercepted
thousands of packages

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.405
of fake coronavirus
vaccine cards from China.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:48.341
And you can tell they're fake
because they fit in your wallet.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:52.745
Tickets went on sale last week
for an immersive experience

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.580
based on the Netflix show
"Bridgerton."

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.417
And as a reminder,
the first three rows

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:00.019
are in the splash zone.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:01.921
Ali.
Take it up with Ali.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.989
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.825
Yesterday was
National Wife Appreciation Day,

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:09.295
and Rudy Giuliani
got his a card.

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.464
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:15.034
And finally, brewer Sam Adams
is releasing

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:19.638
a new limited-edition beer that
contains 28% alcohol by volume.

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:22.808
Said Boston residents, "Aw,
Christ, not another light beer."

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:24.911
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

